#: ../../Device Manager.rst:2
msgid "Device Manager"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Device Manager.rst:4
msgid ""
"The CharaChorder Device Manager is the one-stop-shop for users with a "
"CCOS-powered device. It boasts high quality graphics, animations and a "
"simple user interface. On the device manager, you can change your "
"device's :ref:`layout<Device Manager:Layout>`, manage your :ref:`chord "
"library<Device Manager:Library>`, and adjust your :ref:`settings<Device "
"Manager:Device>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../Device Manager.rst:6
msgid ""
"In this section, we'll talk about the device manager and how you can "
"navigate around it to configure your device to your liking. First, we'll "
"discuss the website and where to find useful buttons on it, then we'll "
"cover the main pages on the device manager and how to use them, and, "
"lastly, we'll touch upon some other features and useful tools on the "
"manager."
msgstr ""

#: ../../Device Manager.rst:8
msgid ""
"Feel free to use the links below to skip to whatever section you would "
"like to read or scroll to start with the first section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../Device Manager.rst:12
msgid "Table of Contents of this Page"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Device Manager.rst:15
msgid "Connecting to the Device Manager"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Device Manager.rst:17
msgid ""
"You can follow the steps below to connect to the device manager for the "
"first time."
msgstr ""

